#: omake:omake_7857BB11_341C_47CB_BC0C_845B87181520
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3958a4dca0f5d2d645292f694316d1a4020aea5fbcf4389a00649f7b47b87e5b
