"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If I’m not mistaken, the Maid had cue cards in the ⟪k:3⟫other⟪k:4⟫ extra as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se non sbaglio, la Domestica aveva delle carte profilo anche durante l’extra della "
"demo."

#: omake:omake_0C1A5A5D_E844_492A_B3FC_6EB72EA38AB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4b555950add11c2e3ac226c396b2353f66187bac71c38feafe67f871bd61bdb
