msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, since we’re here, maybe we should start with the two of you before we "
"head out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sapete, visto che ci troviamo, forse dovremmo iniziare con voi due,⟪k:3⟫prima di "
"partire."

#: omake:omake_D8F9ED98_CB55_414A_BCD3_1718D1E71F73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 019119f804127645ab36b0b9883afa4840840f9191961769d524983c5902ef82
