msgctxt "omake:omake_C735FC1D_0557_4962_A5BB_14F11B1C53E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is true... ⟪k:2⟫At first, Mell seemed like a fairly likable young man,⟪k:3⟫but by "
"the end of his chapter, he had revealed himself as a helplessly worthless child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ vero... ⟪k:4⟫All’inizio, Mell sembrava un ragazzo in gamba, ma alla fine "
"della sua porta, si è dimostrato un ragazzino debole e codardo."

